{"2962780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BeastLink", "steam_appid": 2962780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/5f65f7329aa5e4385767cf6b59d77ee1.avif?t=1788294412\" width=870 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world didn’t end. It evolved. Humanity survives in shattered strongholds, colossal creatures rule the ruins, and survival depends on the very technology that ended everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/c417f610b02346b956d84f8259c679c9.avif?t=1788294412\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras_big/c417f610b02346b956d84f8259c679c9.avif?t=1788294412 width=1560 height=1018 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BeastLink</i> is a brand new experience where humans, vehicles, and colossal Beasts collide in fully destructible cities at unprecedented scale. Fight your way through war-torn urban cities, amass the coveted serum, and use it to Link with towering Beasts, each with unique abilities and combat styles. Play as both human and beast across multiple game modes solo or with other players. Deploy vehicles like cars, helicopters, tanks and aircrafts to unleash chaos, bringing everything crashing down. The stronger your Link grows, the more power you command…and the more it threatens to consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash skyscrapers, obliterate city blocks and reshape the city skyline with our proprietary “SuperDestruction<i>”</i> technology,<i> </i>a groundbreaking destruction system where everything can be reduced to dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/65884cc90979d2cb1201ed88eb725be1.poster.avif?t=1788294412\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/65884cc90979d2cb1201ed88eb725be1.webm?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/65884cc90979d2cb1201ed88eb725be1.mp4?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>BECOME THE BEAST</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn serum and BeastLink with dormant Kaiju, unlocking unique abilities, playstyles, and devastating powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>HUMANS, VEHICLES, AND BEASTS ON ONE BATTLEFIELD</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a human, support your squad with vehicles, or become the ultimate weapon. Every role is needed in large-scale, team-based warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/d617e0e48964a8ce91b5be5847d7fe06.poster.avif?t=1788294412\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/d617e0e48964a8ce91b5be5847d7fe06.webm?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/d617e0e48964a8ce91b5be5847d7fe06.mp4?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>SUPERDESTRUCTION</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level entire cities with a fully-networked, physics-based destruction system. Collapse buildings, carve new paths, and weaponize the environment. Every match reshapes the map - nothing is off limits! Destroy anything you see! Each map contains hundreds of thousands of destructible items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>MULTIPLAYER MAYHEM</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across huge maps designed for up to 32 players and multiple active Beasts, delivering chaotic gameplay at scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/118940fe3e0eccd39449b01c68d4c9de.poster.avif?t=1788294412\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/118940fe3e0eccd39449b01c68d4c9de.webm?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/118940fe3e0eccd39449b01c68d4c9de.mp4?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>MASTER UNIQUE BEASTS</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a growing roster of Beasts each with distinct strengths, abilities, and playstyles, from agile aerial hunters to relentless close-range brutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A WORLD ON THE EDGE</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the world-ending outbreak and the cost of keeping humanity alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world didn’t end. It evolved. Humanity survives in shattered strongholds, colossal creatures rule the ruins, and survival depends on the very technology that ended everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/c417f610b02346b956d84f8259c679c9.avif?t=1788294412\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras_big/c417f610b02346b956d84f8259c679c9.avif?t=1788294412 width=1560 height=1018 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BeastLink</i> is a brand new experience where humans, vehicles, and colossal Beasts collide in fully destructible cities at unprecedented scale. Fight your way through war-torn urban cities, amass the coveted serum, and use it to Link with towering Beasts, each with unique abilities and combat styles. Play as both human and beast across multiple game modes solo or with other players. Deploy vehicles like cars, helicopters, tanks and aircrafts to unleash chaos, bringing everything crashing down. The stronger your Link grows, the more power you command…and the more it threatens to consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash skyscrapers, obliterate city blocks and reshape the city skyline with our proprietary “SuperDestruction<i>”</i> technology,<i> </i>a groundbreaking destruction system where everything can be reduced to dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/65884cc90979d2cb1201ed88eb725be1.poster.avif?t=1788294412\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/65884cc90979d2cb1201ed88eb725be1.webm?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/65884cc90979d2cb1201ed88eb725be1.mp4?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>BECOME THE BEAST</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn serum and BeastLink with dormant Kaiju, unlocking unique abilities, playstyles, and devastating powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>HUMANS, VEHICLES, AND BEASTS ON ONE BATTLEFIELD</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a human, support your squad with vehicles, or become the ultimate weapon. Every role is needed in large-scale, team-based warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/d617e0e48964a8ce91b5be5847d7fe06.poster.avif?t=1788294412\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/d617e0e48964a8ce91b5be5847d7fe06.webm?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/d617e0e48964a8ce91b5be5847d7fe06.mp4?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>SUPERDESTRUCTION</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level entire cities with a fully-networked, physics-based destruction system. Collapse buildings, carve new paths, and weaponize the environment. Every match reshapes the map - nothing is off limits! Destroy anything you see! Each map contains hundreds of thousands of destructible items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>MULTIPLAYER MAYHEM</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across huge maps designed for up to 32 players and multiple active Beasts, delivering chaotic gameplay at scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/118940fe3e0eccd39449b01c68d4c9de.poster.avif?t=1788294412\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/118940fe3e0eccd39449b01c68d4c9de.webm?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/extras/118940fe3e0eccd39449b01c68d4c9de.mp4?t=1788294412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>MASTER UNIQUE BEASTS</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a growing roster of Beasts each with distinct strengths, abilities, and playstyles, from agile aerial hunters to relentless close-range brutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A WORLD ON THE EDGE</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the world-ending outbreak and the cost of keeping humanity alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "BeastLink is a giant multiplayer Kaiju game featuring intense PvP or PvE combat. Humans, vehicles and Beasts collide in urban environments where everything &amp; everyone can be destroyed. Build your Link, command giant Kaijus, and unleash devastating power before it consumes you!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“A truly massive third-person shooter that combines the scope of Battlefield with the destruction and monsters of Pacific Rim into one truly ambitious project.”<br>Screen Rant<br><br>“As a kaiju fan I loved the variety of kaijus and game modes you got to play.  I will absolutely be playing this when the game is fully released!”<br>AzusaKairu<br><br>“Buildings crumble. Streets disappear. Entire city blocks become weapons.”<br>The Xbox Hub<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/2eff0c54882c0eaa69ddc7db57b92d7e88959d77/header.jpg?t=1788294412", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/5a2dd997274a25b8ad6db846ecd75260459b5095/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788294412", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962780/5a2dd997274a25b8ad6db846ecd75260459b5095/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788294412", "website": "https://playbeastlink.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 (2.7 GHz 4 Core) / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X (3.5 GHz 4 Core) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-8700 (3.7 GHz 6 Core) / AMD Ryzen 7 2700X (3.7 GHz 8 Core) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3070 /